The  driver  provides  support  for the DEC TURBOchannel PMAZ‐DS,
PMAZ‐FS, PMAZB‐AA and PMAZC‐AA dual‐channel SCSI adapters.   Each
channel  is  driven  by  the  driver.  The PMAZ‐FS (Alpha onboard
only) and PMAZC‐AA (option board) provide two  Fast  Narrow  SCSI
busses,  while the PMAX‐DS (Alpha onboard only) and PMAZB‐AA only
provide Narrow SCSI.  For the onboard Alpha controllers, one  bus
is for internal devices and one bus for external devices.
